export anchor ArcticStyle:
    number: 284
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Arctic
    idea: A calm frost-toned review page in cool blue-grey, with a quiet three-card glance row over the files, the diff and a slim facts column, soft 10px corners and pale ice-blue as the only strong accent.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #20252d, the page background and the diff code area
        panel: #2a313b, the header band, cards, the side column and the style sheet cards
        raised: #353e4b, the selected tab pill, hover, chips and the disabled merge button
        line: #4a5566, every border and divider
        snow: #e6ecf3, text
        mist: #b0bccb, meta, labels and line numbers
        frost: #8fc6d8, links, the current tab, the primary button and focus
        frostInk: #14202a, text on frost
        aurora: #a9d18e, passed, approved, added counts and added signs
        thaw: #e8c27a, requested changes
        rose: #ef9aa0, failing, removed counts and removed signs
        addTint: #25372f, added line rows
        delTint: #3a2a31, removed line rows
    type:
        One system sans stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial,
        base 15px at 1.5. The pull request title is 28px at 600, section titles 17px
        at 600, side labels 12px caps tracked 0.08em in mist, counts with tabular
        numbers. Code is 13px ui-monospace at 1.6.
    layout:
        A centered 1160px column. A panel coloured band holds the Brightwork Code
        mark, the owner and repository name with a Private chip, and Watch 12, Star
        48 and Fork 3 as small outlined buttons. Under it the six tabs sit in one
        rounded segmented pill, the current tab filled with raised and an ice blue
        underline dot. The title with number 214 and the Open chip and merge line
        come next. A glance row of three equal cards follows, checks with a twelve
        segment bar, reviewers, and labels. Then two columns, a wide one with the
        files list with small plus and minus bars and the diff card with the inline
        comment, and a 300px facts column with assignees, labels, milestone, linked
        issue and the merge box. Below 900px everything stacks and the glance cards
        stack below 640px.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px card padding, 16px between cards, 40px between the header and the title block.
    density: Low to medium. Generous whitespace, one idea per card.
    corners: Soft. 10px cards, 999px tab pill and chips, 8px buttons and fields.
    borders: 1px line on every card and row. The diff hunk header and the comment have a 3px frost left edge.
    shadows: None. Separation comes from the panel tint and the thin lines.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.6px stroke sized at 1.1em. Passed and approved use a
        check circle, failing a crossed square, requested changes a triangle with a
        bang, Open the pull request glyph and the blocked merge a padlock, always
        beside the word.
    focus: A 2px frost outline offset 2px, with a 4px dark gap so it reads on every panel.
    tone: Calm and plain, such as 11 of 12 checks passed and Merging is blocked until all checks pass.
